  "description": "<p>This Christian welcome doormat offers a warm, spiritually enriching entryway to any home. Featuring uplifting messages and faith-filled designs, it creates a welcoming atmosphere for guests. This versatile doormat also provides a personal touch and a blessed vibe to your space.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features Christian-themed designs and uplifting messages</li>\n<li>Allows for text customization to create a unique doormat</li>\n<li>Soft to the touch for comfort on bare feet</li>\n<li>Equipped with a non-slip backing for stability</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor placement</li>\n<li>Designed to dry wet feet and capture dirt and grime</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Multiple</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Washable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>customized prayer mat with name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Christian, Jesus, Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Surface/Feel</td>\n<td>Soft touching on bare feet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Do not bleach and let air dry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Machine Wash, Hose or sponge clean with water and mild liquid soap</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is highly versatile, making it suitable for various spaces. It can be placed in bedrooms, bathrooms, and living rooms, or used as an entryway accent for both indoor and outdoor settings.</p>",
